+   *    - BufferUsage::CAMERA_*
+   *    - BufferUsage::CPU_*
+   *    - BufferUsage::GPU_TEXTURE
+   *
+   * The component values are unsigned normalized to the range [0, 1], whose
+   * interpretation is defined by the dataspace.
+   */
